<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Budimex started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Budimex started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities analyst Gene Linetsky started coverage of Polish construction company Budimex SA with a rating of market performer.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The FY96 results at Budimex have suffered from the harsh and long winter of 1995-96, but the recent mild winter and improving profitability should contribute to better results this year,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although a recent equity-financed acquisition should dilute (earnings per share) in 1997, we believe that the stock will be attractive to investors with a long-term outlook.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Linetsky estimated 1997 earnings per share at $0.95.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
